      "statement": "createCodeModeWorkflow emits a workflow_dispatch-plus-scheduled GitHub Actions job running openwiki code --update --print on a default cron of 0 8 * * *, with contents/pull-requests write permissions; it pins actions to commit SHAs (actions/checkout v4 with fetch-depth 0, actions/setup-node v4 on Node 22, peter-evans/create-pull-request v7), installs openwiki plus optional mermaid/jsdom, runs with continue-on-error so a page failure does not abort, deletes openwiki/.run.json, opens a PR scoped to openwiki/AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md/the workflow file even on failure, and a final step exits 1 when steps.openwiki.outcome == 'failure' to propagate the failure.",
